post_message -- {"message": "Beacon Works - are you planning to use Hydro or Biomass for your assignments? 

I want to make sure we coordinate effectively. I'm planning to use Biomass for my high-power EV charger (3.8kW, 5-7) and possibly my evening kiln (2.1kW, 17-22) to help reduce contention on Hydro during peak hours.

This would leave Hydro available for machines that really need it during 7-9 and 11-12 hours. What's your approach?", "blackboard_id": 1}
